### 🔹 Full n8n Workflow JSON

```json
{
  "name": "Veo3 Short Video Generation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/veo-3.0-generate-001:predictLongRunning",
        "method": "POST",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "jsonParameters": true,
        "options": {},
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParametersJson": "={\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"prompt\": \"A cinematic sunrise over the mountains, soft ambient audio, birds chirping, cinematic style.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"durationSeconds\": 8,\n    \"resolution\": \"1080p\",\n    \"aspectRatio\": \"16:9\",\n    \"generateAudio\": true\n  }\n}"
      },
      "id": "2",
      "name": "Generate Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [550, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "const operation = $json.name;\nreturn [{ json: { operation } }];"
      },
      "id": "3",
      "name": "Extract Operation Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [800, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{\"https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/\" + $json[\"operation\"]}}",
        "method": "GET",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseFormat": "json",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "4",
      "name": "Check Operation Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1050, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Gemini API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "functionCode": "if ($json.done) {\n  const uri = $json.response?.videoUri || null;\n  return [{ json: { uri } }];\n} else {\n  return [{ json: { retry: true } }];\n}"
      },
      "id": "5",
      "name": "Check If Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.function",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1300, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{$json[\"uri\"]}}",
        "method": "GET",
        "authentication": "none",
        "responseFormat": "file",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6",
      "name": "Download Video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1550, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fileName": "veo3_output.mp4",
        "dataPropertyName": "data"
      },
      "id": "7",
      "name": "Save MP4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.writeBinaryFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1800, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Generate Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Generate Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Operation Name",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Extract Operation Name": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check Operation Status",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check Operation Status": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Check If Done",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Check If Done": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download Video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Download Video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Save MP4",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

---

### ⚠️ Setup Notes
1. Replace `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID` with your n8n **HTTP Header Auth** credential that has:
   - Header name: `Authorization`  
   - Value: `Bearer YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY`

2. The “Check Operation Status” node only runs once here. In practice, you’ll want a **Loop/Wait** around it until `done=true`. (n8n has a [Wait or IF + Loopback pattern](https://docs.n8n.io/workflows/looping/).) Right now, it will exit early if not done.  

3. The `videoUri` in the response may point to a Google Cloud Storage signed URL. That’s what the **Download Video** node fetches.  

